      "status": 200,
      "body": "# SSSInstagram\n\n> SSSInstagram is a free Instagram downloader that works in the browser with no\n> account and nothing to install. Paste a link to a public post, reel, story,\n> highlight or profile and the file comes back in the resolution Instagram\n> stores: photos as JPG, videos as MP4, carousels slide by slide, all without a\n> watermark. Available in 29 languages. No Instagram login is ever requested.\n> An Android app is offered separately for people who prefer to download from\n> the share menu.\n\nScope and limits: only public accounts work here — content of private profiles\nis not accessible, and that restriction is enforced by Instagram, not bypassed.\nStories can be downloaded while Instagram still serves them, which is 24 hours\nafter posting; highlights stay until the account owner removes them. Files are\npassed through without recompression and without a watermark.\n\n## Tools\n\n- [Instagram downloader (English)](https://sssinstagram.com/en1)\n- [Video downloader](https://sssinstagram.com/en1/video-downloader)\n- [Photo downloader](https://sssinstagram.com/photo-downloader)\n- [Reels downloader](https://sssinstagram.com/reels-downloader)\n- [Story saver](https://sssinstagram.com/story-saver)\n- [Highlights downloader](https://sssinstagram.com/highlights-downloader)\n- [How to save photos from Instagram](https://sssinstagram.com/how-to-download-instagram-pictures)\n\n## Languages\n\n- [Spanish](https://sssinstagram.com/es)\n- [Portuguese](https://sssinstagram.com/pt)\n- [Indonesian](https://sssinstagram.com/id)\n- [Turkish](https://sssinstagram.com/tr)\n- [French](https://sssinstagram.com/fr)\n- [German](https://sssinstagram.com/de)\n- [Italian](https://sssinstagram.com/it)\n- [Russian](https://sssinstagram.com/ru)\n- [Arabic](https://sssinstagram.com/ar)\n- [Persian](https://sssinstagram.com/fa)\n- [Hindi](https://sssinstagram.com/hi)\n- [Bengali](https://sssinstagram.com/bn)\n- [Japanese](https://sssinstagram.com/ja)\n- [Korean](https://sssinstagram.com/ko)\n- [Chinese](https://sssinstagram.com/zh)\n- [Thai](https://sssinstagram.com/th)\n- [Vietnamese](https://sssinstagram.com/vi)\n- [Malay](https://sssinstagram.com/ms)\n- [Dutch](https://sssinstagram.com/nl)\n- [Polish](https://sssinstagram.com/pl)\n- [Czech](https://sssinstagram.com/cs)\n- [Slovak](https://sssinstagram.com/sk)\n- [Hungarian](https://sssinstagram.com/hu)\n- [Romanian](https://sssinstagram.com/ro)\n- [Greek](https://sssinstagram.com/el)\n- [Serbian](https://sssinstagram.com/sr)\n- [Swedish](https://sssinstagram.com/sv)\n- [Ukrainian](https://sssinstagram.com/uk)\n\n## For Developers and AI Assistants\n\n- [Instagram API](https://sssinstagram.com/api): REST access to publicly\n  available Instagram media and profile data: usernames, profile bios and\n  follower statistics, public posts and reels with captions and media URLs,\n  timestamps, likes and comment counts, public stories and highlights,\n  followers, following and post comments. The page describes the available\n  data and how to request access.\n- [Instagram MCP server](https://sssinstagram.com/mcp): Model Context Protocol\n  server that gives AI assistants and agents access to public Instagram data —\n  profile bios and follower statistics, public media URLs with captions and\n  publication dates, stories and highlights, likes, comments and follower or\n  following lists. It works with MCP-capable clients and agents such as\n  ChatGPT, Codex, Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code and Gemini CLI. The page\n  has the server address, setup steps for ChatGPT, Claude and any other MCP\n  client, and the plans; 50 requests are free to try. Typical uses: influencer\n  and creator research, profile and\n  audience comparison, monitoring of posts, reels, stories and highlights, and\n  engagement analysis.\n\n## Legal\n\n- [About](https://sssinstagram.com/about)\n- [Privacy Policy](https://sssinstagram.com/privacy)\n",
